@startuml
title API Gateway — JWT Validation via JWKS

actor Client
participant "API Gateway\n(TLS & JWT Validator)" as GW
participant "JWKS Cache" as Cache
participant "Authorization Service\n(JWKS Publisher)" as IAM
participant "Backend Service" as SVC

== Запрос ==
Client -> GW: HTTPS request with Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
GW -> Cache: get(kid) public key?

alt key in cache
  Cache --> GW: public key
else key missing/expired
  GW -> IAM: GET /.well-known → /jwks.json
  IAM --> GW: JWK Set (ETag, max-age)
  GW -> Cache: upsert keys (by kid)
  Cache --> GW: public key (by kid)
end

== Проверка ==
GW -> GW: verify signature (alg pinned)\ncheck iss/aud/exp/nbf/iat (with leeway)
alt invalid token
  GW --> Client: 401 Unauthorized\nWWW-Authenticate: Bearer error="invalid_token"
else valid
  GW -> SVC: forward request (+verified claims headers)\n(mTLS/HTTP2 internal)
  SVC --> GW: response
  GW --> Client: response
end

== Фоновая ротация ==
... periodically ...
GW -> IAM: conditional GET /jwks.json (If-None-Match)
IAM --> GW: 304 Not Modified or 200 New Keys
GW -> Cache: rotate/overlap keys

note right
Локальная проверка 
end note
@enduml